  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening National and Regional Capacities for Preventing and Countering Hate  Speech and Disinformation in the Horn of Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen national and regional (African Union Commission/AUC and Intergovernmental Authority on Development/IGAD) capacities to prevent and counter hate speech and disinformation in the Horn of Africa (HoA). This, in turn, is aimed at strengthening peacebuilding and social cohesion in the HoA. The overall engagement intervention aims to contribute to the (PSF) Peace and Stabilization Fund priority of developing capacity for conflict prevention, including through countering disinformation.</narrative>
  </description>
